seg-816770c97995 = <c1/> chains phases of a mission, each one of eight registered kinds with its own sensors and filter, and reports the <b>navigation and timing error budget</b> of the whole chain: for every phase the 1-sigma position, velocity and clock bias at entry, at the peak and at exit; every contribution to it, with its unit; the margin against a requirement you state; the weakest link; the dated events; and a timeline figure. Every number is <b>MODELLED</b>: a stated input or a model of one. The only external oracle rows are in <s1><c2/></s1> and say what they test.

