seg-e5a67295a5ae = Updates, used only when the document lists the source: <c1/> (position fixes with availability and PDOP from the engine's space-service-volume sweep along an osculating Earth orbit standing in for the arc, one sweep per <c2/>; fix sigma = median PDOP times <c3/>; the expected-information form keeps the run deterministic) and <c4/> (range and range rate along the geocentric direction, so the plane of the sky is not observed; the update variance is divided by the tracking duty). Keys: <c5/>, <c6/>, <c7/>, <c8/>, <c9/>, <c10/>, optional <c11/>, <c12/>, <c13/>, <c14/>, <c15/>, <c16/>, <c17/>, <c18/>, <c19/>.

