# text
# c1: xval/mission-thread-lunar/
# c2: xval/mission-thread/
seg-1168810d4407 = The thread's label is the weakest phase label, and every phase is MODELLED. The lunar propagator is compared with LRO and CAPSTONE (<s1><c1/></s1>); the cislunar arc is compared with a public Horizons trajectory (<s2><c2/></s2>). A row passes or misses a bar fixed in a committed file before the run, and a miss is recorded as a miss. Nothing is VALIDATED unless the ledger says so.

